<title>MEXICO: Mexico October maquiladora employment rises.</title>
<headline>Mexico October maquiladora employment rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Employment in Mexico's maquiladora export sector rose 21.2 percent in October compared with the same month a year earlier, the government's statistics agency said.</p>
<p>The National Statistics, Geography and Information Institute said that in October there were 809,434 persons occupied.</p>
<p>--Cecilia Cardenas, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289552</p>
